nomous beasts / creatures","766":"biting of a mad dog: rabies","834":"opens obstructions of / strengthens the liver","920":"reins: kidneys","930":"provokes urine: diuretic","969":"the stone (urinary calculus)","979":"gravel: small urinary concretions","997":"kidneys","1009":"bladder","1047":"pains (unlocalised): analgesic","1057":"ulcers (old, foul, running, fretting)","1142":"wounds (green, fresh, inward, old); wound-herb","1213":"ulcers (old, foul, running, fretting)","1355":"mists before the eyes","1371":"film over the eye","1434":"tooth-ache","1551":"haemorrhoids (hæmorrhoids, morrhoids)","1566":"piles: haemorrhoids"}},"images":[]}